        "mode": "tldr",
        "content": "Append-only log of direction flips and key level breaks. Only material changes are recorded.\n\n---\n\n- **2026-04-11** \u2014 swing_20260411_211655: BUY signal (conf 58%). Setup: volume-confirmed gap breakout from $281 Medicare Advantage catalyst. Entry limit $296, target $320, stop $288. Order placed but never filled \u2014 stock did not pull back to $296.\n- **2026-04-30** \u2014 20260430_194522: HOLD / no trade (conf 35%). **Direction flip: buy \u2192 wait.** Prior \"buy the dip to $296\" setup is now superseded. Stock surged +41.6% in 21 days to $370.74. RSI 94.3, z-score 2.54, ADX 81.64 \u2014 all at statistical extremes. R/R at current price is 0.5:1, failing the 2:1 minimum. Prior measured-move target of ~$331 was achieved and exceeded. Wait for pullback to $348\u2013355 EMA zone. (Source: swing_head_trader signal, decisions.json, run 20260430_194522.)",
